00:22:34.000 --> 00:23:01.000
but no such chink ever appears. He behaves with such dignity and grace. And he tells him, don't kneel to me, kneel to God only. And that kind of has a resonance because the The Emancipation Statue that then gets built after the war shows a freed slave on his knee in front of Lincoln. And that's been very controversial now. But Lincoln was ahead of the game, really. He wouldn't have approved of that statue. No, he wouldn't actually.
但从来没有出现过这样的裂缝。他表现出如此的尊严和优雅。他告诉他，不要向我跪拜，只向上帝跪拜。这在某种程度上引起了共鸣，因为战后建造的《解放雕像》展示了一个获释的奴隶跪在林肯面前。这现在一直很有争议。但林肯确实走在了时代的前面。他不会赞成那个雕像的。不，他不会的。

50
00:23:01.000 --> 00:23:16.000
It's a really good point. It's a really good point. Anyway, they walk into the city. It's a war zone still. I mean, it's a city with smoldering buildings. There's a pall of smoke. It is incredibly hot. There's a famous moment, another famous moment, again very much
